# Privacy Policy — BizNote

Last updated: 2026-08-17

BizNote ("the App") is developed by Jyun Kim.

## Data We Collect
The App collects business card information (name, company, phone, email,
address) that you scan using the camera. This data is stored locally on
your device and, if iCloud is enabled, synced via Apple's CloudKit.

## How We Use Your Data
All collected data is used solely to provide the App's core features:
note management and business card storage. We do not sell, share, or
transmit your data to any third party.

## Camera Permission
The App requests camera access to scan business cards using Apple's
document scanner. The camera is never used for any other purpose.

## iCloud Sync
If you enable iCloud, your notes and business card data are synced
across your devices via Apple CloudKit. Apple's privacy policy applies
to this data in transit and storage.

